 },
 "about": "Keeps the subject of the owner's picture - its design, colours and art style - and changes what the prompt says (pose, background, props). The hosted NVIDIA Kontext only takes its own example pictures, so this runs in the GPU machine's ComfyUI (Q4_K_M GGUF fits an 8 GB card). Every edited picture is then cut out with BiRefNet and set on plain light grey: the editor leaves signatures, ground patches and shadows that a vision check may not see; a cut-out by shape always removes what is not attached to the subject (2026-11-01).",
